{"sourceUrl":"https://ggxy.hznu.edu.cn/c/2026-09-18/3217701.shtml","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:19.212441+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ggxy.hznu.edu.cn/c/2026-09-18/3217701.shtml","html":"<div><p><span>根据上级部门有关研究生招生规定的</span><span><span>精神，</span></span><span>经审议通过</span><span>，</span><span><span>我</span></span><span>院</span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>接收推荐免试</span><span><span>硕士研究生复试</span></span><span>实施细则</span><span>如下：</span></p><p><span>一、</span><strong><span>复试工作原则</span></strong></p><p><span>坚持以人为本，</span><span>科学选拔</span><span><span>；</span></span><span>坚持</span><span>公平公正</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>客观评价；</span><span>坚持全面考查</span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>确保生源质量。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>二、</span></strong><strong><span>推免材料审核</span></strong></p><p><span>（一）提交申请材料</span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>．第二代居民身份证、学生证复印件</span><span>(</span><span>身份证复印正反面，学生证复印学生信息和注册情况</span><span>) </span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>．大学英语六级</span><span>(</span><span>或四级</span><span>)</span><span>考试证书（小语种的相应水平证书）复印件</span><span>1</span><span>份。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span><span>．大学本科专业成绩及排名情况（须加盖教务</span></span><span>处公章）</span><span>，</span><span>学习期</span><span><span>间获得的各类奖励证明材料复印件各</span><span>1</span><span>份。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span><span>．在校期间取得的学术科研成果（如公开发表论文、出版物等）、发明专利等相关证明材料复印件各</span><span>1</span><span>份。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span><span>．个人简历</span><span>1</span><span>份。 </span></span></p><p><span>注：</span><span><span>请将以上申请材料电子稿按顺序合并为一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，以“姓名</span><span>+</span><span>报考专业”命名在</span></span><span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日下午</span><span>16</span><span>点</span></span><span>前</span><span><span>发送至邮箱：</span><span>ggxyyjs@hznu.edu.cn</span></span><span>。（申请人应保证其所提供的材料真实，一旦发现申请人弄虚作假，即取消其申请资格、录取资格）</span></p><p><span>（二）</span><span>材料审核</span></p><p><span><span>根据招生计划和推免生申请情况，学院成立专家组审核推免生申请材料，审核内容及评分标准（总</span><span>100</span><span>分）：本科专业成绩及排名情况（</span><span>40</span><span>分）；外语水平情况（</span><span>20</span><span>分）；科研创新及竞赛获奖情况（</span><span>30</span><span>分）；其他与攻读硕士研究生有关的因素（</span><span>10</span><span>分），择优确定</span></span><span><span>进入下一轮考核的考生名单。</span></span><span>材料审核分不计入复试总成绩，</span><span>学院审核专家组对材料审核后，公布</span><span>复试名单。</span></p><p><span>三、</span><strong><span>复试时间和地点</span></strong></p><p><span>我院拟在</span><span><span>9</span><span>月底</span></span><span>举行，具体时间、地点另行通知（请关注研招网推免服务系统</span><span>通知</span><span>并保持手机联系畅通）。</span></p><p><strong><span>四、复试形式和内容</span></strong></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span>．我院招生专业均采用</span><span>现场复试形</span><span>式。</span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span>．复试内容包括专业素质和能力、综合素质和能力、外语听说能力和思想品德考核等部分。复试以面试为主，</span><span>面试</span><span>时间</span><span>每生</span><span><span>一般不少于</span><span>20</span><span>分钟。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>．复试结束后，拟录取申请人按照学院要求在规定时间内登陆</span><span>“推免服务系统”，接收确认“待录取”通知，否则视为放弃拟录取资格。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>五、复试成绩计算</span></strong></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span>．专业素质和能力测试成绩（</span><span>40%<span>）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span>．综合素质和能力测试成绩（</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>0%<span>）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span>．外语听力口语测试成绩（</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>0%<span>）</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>复试</span><span><span>总</span></span><span><span>分</span></span><span><span>为</span></span><span>100</span><span><span>分，</span></span><span><span>复试</span></span><span><span>分数</span></span><span><span>低于</span><span>60 </span><span>分（未达到满分的 </span><span>60%</span><span>）即为复试不合格，思想品德考核不合格或复试不合格者不予录取。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>六、<strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>．<span>学</span><span>院</span><span>研究生</span><span>招生</span><span>委员会</span>对复试过程的公平、公正和复试结果全面监督、负责。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>．纪检、监察部门对复试工作进行全面、有效监督，对复试现场进行巡视。监督举报邮箱</span></span><span>：</span><a href=\"mailto:hsdggxy@126.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>hsdggxy@126.com</span></span></a><span>，</span><span><span>电话：</span><span>0571-28867053</span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span><span>．复</span></span><span>试工作联系</span><span>人</span><span>：姜老师</span><span>，</span><span>电话</span><span><span>：</span><span>0</span></span><span>571-</span><span>2886</span><span>0519</span><span>，</span><span>邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:ggxyyjs@hznu.edu.cn%E3%80%82\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>ggxyyjs@hznu.edu.cn</span><span>。</span></span></a></p><p><span><span>4</span><span>．</span></span><span>其他未尽事宜按照教育部、浙江省教育考试院及我校最新文件通知规定执行。</span></p><p><span>                                                                                </span><span>杭州师范大学公共管理学院</span><span></span></p><p><span> </span><span>                                        202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span>18</span><span>日</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"6190eb14b2b3b92df09b8bc24c9df092777d47e36f1d66a094b1864403bf8e30","textLength":1153,"sourceSha256":"0f79fcdbb279c2008fb9cdf331572815b40cf151197d03dd77a5589e803b10c7","selector":"article-like:sp-content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-12c0d28fd2ef10d11a5b","title":"2026年杭州师范大学公共管理学院2027年接收推荐免试硕士研究生招生复试实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:19.212441+00:00"}
